  longerTitle: Elderly Resident
  description: Older residents may need additional time and support to evacuate safely.
    It is very important to make plans in advance and consider multiple scenarios
    and consequences of choices. Some adult children and grand children choose to
    drive a great distance to pick up their elderly relative, but this can cause
    delays and additional congestion. Consider making a plan with a neighbor who
    can help them evacuate, or arranging to evacuate them early before there is an
    evacuation notice.
